# KQM Sandrone quick guide, example team 3:
# Yae Miko 3[E] > Qiqi E > Beidou EQ > Sandrone [combo]
# Beidou bursts when ready: her 20 s burst cooldown is longer than the
# rotation, so bursting every rotation would make the team wait.
# Sandrone's C0 combo 3[C E] (Q), the burst after the first skill.
active yaemiko;
yaemiko skill:3;
qiqi skill;
beidou skill;
if .beidou.burst.ready {
  beidou burst;
}
sandrone charge, skill, burst,
         charge, skill,
         charge, skill;
